#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0329 expect=violation domain=TE
#note "NEITHER column is declared, so the All leg is unmet and the parent skips - unchanged in verdict from the Any gate, but the state is no longer silent: the dataset sister CDISC-CG9676 (Sensitivity Dataset) reports the absent pair once. The old DIRECTION-PIN reasoning written for the Any leg is retired with the wave E Any -> All rewrite; the direction is now pinned by the four-state set (parent + two R-5.25 siblings + sister), whose scenarios each name the member owning the neighbouring state."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT | Treatment | First dose
